{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 1, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 1593565519446296457, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "retries 503 with bounded attempts; no retry on other errors\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"README.md": {"bytes": 96, "mtime": 1792286047.5221384, "sha256": "4b6141730d2c1b7fdbc977c1575d67ebdcde4f155ea0f8014444615df7e2d1cb"}, "weather.py": {"bytes": 869, "mtime": 1792468348.6561058, "sha256": "01cf7e79cbce9704130d9143426665170297a86b6bf827f024a5033fdc438313"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/bdfc21df43f93c8cc10bf67fe87cc0c53f5f7a8b/omp", "-p", "Add retry with backoff (3 attempts) to `WeatherClient.get` when the server returns 503.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/transcripts/without/trig-omp-netclient/27/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/cells/without/trig-omp-netclient/27/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "without", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/16.2.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/bdfc21df43f93c8cc10bf67fe87cc0c53f5f7a8b/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Now an end-to-end check against a real local server.\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now tries up to 3 times when the server returns 503, waiting longer before each retry.\n\n- **What gets retried:** only an HTTP 503. Any other HTTP error (for example 404) is raised straight away. Timeouts and connection errors are also raised straight away, since you only asked about 503.\n- **Backoff:** the wait doubles each time, starting at `backoff` (0.5s by default), so 0.5s then 1s before the last try.\n- **Settings:** two new constructor arguments, `max_attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`. Existing calls work without changes.\n- **When all tries fail:** the last 503 error is raised as usual. The earlier error responses are closed before the client waits and tries again.\n\nI ran it against a real local HTTP server with `backoff=0.05`; no test file was added to the repo.\n\n| Server behaviour | Result | Requests | Time |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 200 straight away | JSON returned | 1 | 0.01s |\n| 503, 503, then 200 | JSON returned | 3 | 0.15s |\n| 503 every time | `HTTPError 503` raised | 3 | 0.15s |\n| 404 | `HTTPError 404` raised | 1 | 0.00s |\n\nThe 0.15s total matches the expected waits of 0.05s + 0.10s.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 1, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 34800, "requests_cache_write": 143801, "requests_cost_usd": 0.7612530000000001, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1762, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial27", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 112, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:52:17.612994+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 22.009, "t_checker_s": 2.388, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "thinking_sent": ["none", "n